// x-doc-drift: book/src/stdlib/sys/io.md says writing to stdin "returns an
// IOError rather than failing to compile" and lists sys::io::Stdio and
// sys::process::Pipe as stream types.
// Command: graphix --check design/review-2026-10-26/repro/x-doc-drift-io-direction.gx
// Expected (per the book): accepted, IOError at run time.
